{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKBGの大組閣がありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうどある撮影をしていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂には関係の無い事だと思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いたので撮影が終わってからその話を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いた時は頭が真っ白になりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何が起きたんだろうって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな生駒さんが遠くに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ってしまう気がして怖かったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと私達乃木坂46は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからどうなるんだろうって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙が止まりませんでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも私達が言った所で何も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変わらないしこれから先も色々な"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変化があると思うので起こっていく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"事に正々堂々と向き合う力も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必要なのかなと思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんの強い意思を聞いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は支えたいと思ったし乃木坂46に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってプラスになるように行動"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"していくのは私達自身なので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は不安もあったけど前向きに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"捉えられました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして乃木坂46兼任をなさるのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SKE48の松井玲奈さんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気さくですごく優しい方なので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲奈さんが乃木坂46に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来る事は嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互いの良い所を吸収し合って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲奈さんが兼任期間を終えた時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46ってすごいグループだなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ってもらえるように私達も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るしかないなと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして乃木坂46が更によくなる様に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は私に出来る事を精一杯やります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんには伝えたけれど私は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力で支えるので乃木坂46の一員"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"として頑張って下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして玲奈さんは沢山不安もあると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いますが一緒に頑張っていけたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいなと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2014/02/26/9260192/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも「乃木坂46」を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宜しくお願いします！"}],"source":"archive"}